{
  "note": "EXT-27: behaviours of the VS Code compatibility layer and its window side, each broken in turn; the tests named must catch it (scripts/conformance-mutations.mjs). Paths are relative to Yavin_2.0.0. EXT-28 adds R1-R21: the runtime (web.js, intl.js, the loader, the random source, rejection reports), each caught by tests/runtime.rs. EXT-29 adds C1-C9 (the window side: prompts, problems, will-save, file events, ownership) and S1-S7 (the layer: watchers, prompts, tokens, validation, code actions, diagnostics batches). EXT-30 adds I1-I8: file icon themes (paths kept inside the package, SVG only and bounded, VS Code's choice of icon, a disabled extension's theme, the manifest's check). EXT-31 adds V01-V09: webview panels (ownership, bounded and ready-gated frame messages, disposal with the extension, messages to the owner only, resource roots, the window's update loop, the window's permission rule), and V10-V11 (only the page the frame was last given is ready; a frame that kept an earlier page is given its page again).",
